# The trigger is independent of its source (CR 113.7a, 608.2): Bot2 answers the Chancery's trigger by sacrificing Wasteland to destroy it. When the trigger resolves, Bot1 still returns a land
# it controls - the Plains, the only one left - so the Chancery ends in the graveyard and the Plains in hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Azorius Chancery
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Wasteland
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Wasteland.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Azorius Chancery.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Wasteland.Activate(Ability: Destroy; Azorius Chancery)
Bot1.Choose(Plains)
Bot1.Pass
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Azorius Chancery
Bot2.Graveyard = Wasteland
